<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 11-DEC.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 11-DEC.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Elvina, with 50 mph winds, is near 13s/79e in the South Indian Ocean, moving west southwest at 12 mph. This track will continue while Elvina slowly strengthens, becoming an increasing threat to shipping. Top winds will reach 75 mph within 48 hours. This storm is no threat to land at this time.  </p>
<p>THERE ARE NO FURTHER EMERGENCY STATEMENTS AT THIS TIME</p>
</text>
